+/// How big the picture is drawn, in canvas units, for the compositor to centre.
+///
+/// Expressed as a multiple of the whole 240x160 texture, not of the 160x144
+/// picture inside it, which matters: the paper around the picture then scales
+/// with it, the lcd3x grid stays aligned to source pixels, and the canvas
+/// clips the overhang -- paper first, picture only once the panel runs out.
+///
+/// Three cases on this 752x560 panel:
